# =============================================================================
# Per-Dockerfile ignore for process-management/Dockerfile.api
#
# The build context is the repo root (jxt-evidence-system/). This Dockerfile
# only COPYs the service source tree:
#   - process-management/   (go.mod depends on the published jxt-core v1.7.0;
#                            there is no local `replace` directive and no
#                            go.work, so neither jxt-core/ nor tests/ need to
#                            be in the build context)
#
# BuildKit uses <Dockerfile-name>.dockerignore in place of the repo-root
# .dockerignore, so here we exclude everything at the repo root and re-include
# only the process-management/ tree, keeping the context small.
# =============================================================================

# Exclude everything under the repo root ...
*
# ... then re-include only the tree this Dockerfile COPYs.
!process-management
!process-management/**

# Universal cruft inside the included tree (never needed to compile).
process-management/.git
process-management/**/.git/
process-management/**/node_modules/
